BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-16-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Kracht: Upper A
DESCRIPTION:Benen rust (powerhike telt als herstel). Na of vóór het powe
 rhiken.\nBankdrukken (barbell) 3×6–8 @RIR2\nIncline dumbbell press 3×8
 –10 @RIR2\nChest-supported row 3×8–10 @RIR2\nLateral raise 3×12–15
  @RIR1\nCable/machine fly 2×10–12 @RIR1\nTriceps pushdown 2×10–12 @R
 IR1\nPallof press (per kant) 2×10–12 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-16-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Lopen: Powerhike loopband 30 min
DESCRIPTION:Herstel na de race én eerste Mozart-hoogtemeters.\nLoopband 1
 2–15% helling\, 5\,0–5\,5 km/u wandelen\, HF < 130\, niet rennen\, han
 den los.\n≈ 350–400 hm. Stop bij kuit- of rugklachten.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-17-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Lopen: Easy 10 km + 6 strides
DESCRIPTION:HF ≤ 145 · 5:40–6:00/km · RPE 2–3\nBenen nog zwaar van
  de race? Dan 8 km en geen strides.\nStrides 6 × 20 s @ ~3:45/km-gevoel\,
  80 s herstel.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-17-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Kracht: Lower A (RIR 3)
DESCRIPTION:Minstens 3 uur na de run. Squat en RDL terug\, licht: RIR 3\, 
 techniek eerst. Onderrug ≥4 → rugvriendelijk wisselen.\nBack squat 3×
 5–6 @RIR3\nRomanian deadlift 3×6–8 @RIR3\nBulgarian split squat (per 
 been\, dumbbells totaal) 3×6–8 @RIR3\nStaande calf raise 3×8–12 @RIR
 1\nTibialis raise 2×15–20 @RIR1\nCopenhagen plank (sec per kant) 2×20
 –30 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-18-c@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:Lopen: Easy 6 km (ochtend)
DESCRIPTION:HF ≤ 140 · 5:50–6:10/km · RPE 2\nDirect daarna de plyo (
 benen zijn dan warm).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-18-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:Plyo: Plyo
DESCRIPTION:Direct na de easy run. Kwaliteit > volume\, volledig herstel t
 ussen sets.\nPogo jumps 3×15\nLaterale pogo's (per kant) 2×10\nSnap-down
  → verticale sprong 3×3\nBox jump (stap eraf) 3×3
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-18-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:Fiets: KICKR Z2 75 min (avond)
DESCRIPTION:10 min opbouw · 60 min @ 60–70% FTP (≈130–150 W KICKR) 
 · HF < 140 · cadans 85–95\nLaatste 10 min: 3 × 1 min 100 rpm\, 1 min 
 rustig. RPE 3.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-18-d@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:Kracht: Lower B licht (20–25 min\, na de fiets)
DESCRIPTION:Direct na de KICKR\, benen zijn warm. Weinig spierpijn: geen n
 ordics en geen excentrische step-ups deze week (drempel morgen).\nRIR 2–
 3.\nLeg press 3×10–12 @RIR2\nHip thrust 3×8–10 @RIR2\nZittende calf 
 raise (soleus) 3×12–15 @RIR1\nHip adduction (machine) 2×12–15 @RIR2\
 nHip abduction (machine) 2×12–15 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-19-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Lopen: 5 × 6 min @ drempel
DESCRIPTION:WU 2\,5 km + loopscholing + 3 strides\n5 × 6 min @ 4:22–4:2
 8/km · 90 s jog (vorige keer 5 min)\nHF mag oplopen tot 165–172 · RPE 
 7\, niet 9\nCD 2 km · totaal ~12–13 km\nEerste blok NIET sneller dan 4:
 22.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-19-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Kracht: Upper B + core
DESCRIPTION:Pull-up (+ extra kg) 4×5–8 @RIR2\nShoulder press (staand/zi
 ttend) 3×6–8 @RIR2\nSingle-arm cable row (per kant) 3×10–12 @RIR2\nR
 ear delt fly 3×12–15 @RIR1\nIncline dumbbell curl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nHam
 mer curl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nSuitcase carry (meter per kant) 3×30–40 @RIR
 2\nHanging knee raise 3×10–15 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-20-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Hyrox: Hyrox engine (benen-zuinig)
DESCRIPTION:WU 8 min ski/row\n5 rondes (was 4)\, RPE 6–7. Geen sled\, ge
 en lunges (lange duurloop morgen).\nSkiErg (meter) 5×500\nRowErg (meter) 
 5×500\nFarmers carry (meter\, kg per hand) 5×40\nWall balls 5×15\nBurpe
 e broad jumps 5×10
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-21-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Lopen: Lange duur 22–24 km
DESCRIPTION:Eerste 17–18 km @ 5:40–5:55 (HF ≤ 145)\nLaatste 5 km @ 5
 :00–5:10 (steady\, HF ≤ 158)\nVoeding: 60–70 g KH/uur vanaf 45 min (
 bijv. Gel 100 elke 25–30 min) → noteer gram/uur + maag.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-22-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T215943Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Fiets: Duurrit 2:00–2:30
DESCRIPTION:Z2 @ 60–70% FTP (≈140–160 W buiten) · HF < 140 · cadan
 s 85–95\nRug: rechtop\, elk half uur 1 min uit het zadel. Maximaal 2:30 
 tot de huisarts groen licht geeft voor langer. Afbreken bij uitstralende p
 ijn.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
